  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "綠色金融",
    "sub_ename": "GREEN FINANCE",
    "describe_ch": "全球暖化與氣候變遷已經變成環境永續發展的一個重要議題,而其中影響全球暖化與氣候變遷的最重要的決定因素就是空汙問題.空汙問題嚴然成為學者及政策制定者一個很重要的研究課題 本課程從金融的觀點探討金融產業因應之道。",
    "describe_eh": " Global warming and climate change has become a more important issue for environment sustainability. One of the most important determinants that affects this global warming and climate change is environment pollution. What cause this global warming and climate change become an important research arena for not only empirical researcher bout also policymakers. In this course that we will offer several suggestion to deal with this issue from the finance point of view.",
